SUMMARY:RDA class starts — Premier Dental Academy\, Longview
DESCRIPTION:Registered Dental Assistant training starts today at the Longvi
 ew campus.\n\nDaytime classes — call or text (903) 913-6444 for current cl
 ass days & times\n\n3 of 8 seats were open when this calendar was built.\n
 \nIn-person tuition is $3\,000 paid in full\, or $3\,500 on a plan ($500 d
 own plus a $3\,000\nbalance in weekly or monthly instalments). Refund and 
 transfer terms: https://www.premierdentalacademyoflongview.com/terms\n\nQu
 estions: (903) 913-6444 · hello@premierdentalacademyoflongview.com
